<title>USA: Strawbridge &amp; Clothier sets qtly div.</title>
<headline>Strawbridge &amp; Clothier sets qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strawbridge &amp; Clothier said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class A common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.128		    $0.275</p>
<p> Pay		  March 24</p>
<p> Record	     March 17</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company was unavailable to discuss the difference between the latest dividend and the prior dividend.</p>
</text>
